## Finish
Stop owned background tools with `fulcrum task terminal stop {{thread}} --all-owned --reason "recovery work complete" --json`, then run `fulcrum finish --bead {{bead}} --thread-id {{thread}} --ownership-operation {{ownership_operation}} --outcome repaired --input - --json` with `summary`, `changes`, `waived_requirements`, `known_defects`, optional exact `source_oid`, and `evidence`. Reconcile any direct intervention before claiming completion.
